          上图\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: center;\">\n          淡\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: center;\">\n          青色区域为Oromia\n         </span>\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;text-align: center;\">\n          ，深紫色为SNNPR\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          而West Arsi这一区域的咖啡与相邻的Sidama的咖啡风味特征非常的相似，所以在埃塞ECX的咖啡分类里，它曾从属于Sidama D分类下（2015版还是这样划分的）；\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p>\n<br/>\n</p>\n<p>\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZc4pl3j5tz4V70xkE08F34ttY6hQ0Edm6ugGjH1aKDUgUrJxyicpygNg/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 551px;height: 467px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.578px;\">\n           最新的一版（2022）的分级里West Arsi也独立升级出来，而其下就只有一员大将就是Nensebo小区域。\n          </span>\n</span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7T63dGPyUPjictQZLtFjiafuZ4ygmvFP86br63SiaIDvOOvAL1THVOJrW7dBOBaaiabtTKBQyicI8Id4Ig/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\" style=\"width: 578px;height: 619px;\"/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n</span>\n<br/>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n          Nensebo区域70%为山区丘陵，咖啡是该区域最重要的经济作物，年产咖啡近500吨，其中90%为水洗处理，10%为日晒处理。\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style=\"white-space: normal;line-height: 1.75em;\">\n<span style=\"font-size: 14px;\">\n<br/>\n</span>\n</section>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/Gr457cyFia7QssXcZ0vKOGWfndtqjsvah8mg2Tht5NFJEh1UXAz9DAayweXI7bH8TJjo9EJib35ia5Vx5XxAoGr5g/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/>\n</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<br/>\n</p>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0em;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;visibility: visible;'>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          公众号的文章栏目有更多的咖啡信息\n         </span>\n</section>\n<section powered-by=\"werss\" style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;color: rgb(34, 34, 34);font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);text-align: center;line-height: 1.75em;'>\n<span style='outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;font-size: 14px;letter-spacing: 0.544px;'>\n          客服微信：sabh_lt （售前/售后/加群）\n         </span>\n</section>\n<p style='margin-bottom: 0px;outline: 0px;font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Helvetica Neue\", \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei UI\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", Arial, sans-serif;letter-spacing: 0.544px;white-space: normal;'>\n<im